{"game": "arma-3", "language": "english", "appid": 107410, "month": "2013-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1367971200, "end_date": 1368662399, "month_true_total": 108, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 11:00:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "4687162", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040773706", "personaname": "Deafening Xilence", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DeafeningXilence/", "num_games_owned": 259, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 24806, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9587, "last_played": 1646729577, "avatar": "9e762280e700306ceb62499fa1417ca1a92095fb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Arma 3 as lots of other people have stated. Isn't your average shooter. You'll probably need a decent rig to run it for starters and after that you will need to scrap everything you ever thought you knew about shooters. \n\nThe campaign is fun and gives new players a way of grasping the basics of what combat is like in the arma world. For extreamly rookie players there are some good tutorial scenarios in game already loaded. A good addition to the series which will help anyone unsure of how to play.\n\nAs for multiplayer and user made missions. Your experience in those is entirely up to the mission creator and wether or not you choose to play with friends or a dedicated ARMA group. My reccomendation is join a group or find a server with a game mode you love.\n\nReplayability is huge and basically infinite i would highly reccomend the purchase of this game.", "timestamp_created": 1368658760, "timestamp_updated": 1419815674, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "688103", "author": {"steamid": "76561197975524805", "personaname": "Oen", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/oen386/", "num_games_owned": 3045, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 799, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 239, "last_played": 1741593509, "avatar": "0f3454bb13af58c62ba26e9ae535fcd681d915b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "For an alpha it is great! Can't wait for beta in a couple of weeks, and then the full release later. There are some performance bugs, but the freedom in multiplayer is unmatched.", "timestamp_created": 1368653230, "timestamp_updated": 1368653230, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5354679", "author": {"steamid": "76561198048412172", "personaname": "PlsBuff", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PlsBuff/", "num_games_owned": 199, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 82712, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 49244, "last_played": 1722924310, "avatar": "ddcdc9af5affe564873756f64ef35dd84c23955c"}, "language": "english", "review": "So, I've been playing ArmA 3 since it was in its Alpha Stage and I really like this game. If you're a fan of MilSims, this is a must have. But even if you're not, there's always other things you can do here instead of shooting at people. Take AltisLife or the Life Gametypes in general for example. You can just socialize, make friendships and make money, if you're interested in that sort of thing.\n\nIt's not the most realistic game out there when it comes to vehicles, but there's no Game out there at this time, that offers you Infantry and Vehicle Gameplay on this scale that is this realistic.", "timestamp_created": 1368649457, "timestamp_updated": 1492417864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5123931", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045312940", "personaname": "Goldenarm 13th", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198045312940/", "num_games_owned": 185, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 7497, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1095, "last_played": 1387248320, "avatar": "e954d9a2ed7de4d64cd612dda2ccbc68dd6b56d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "The reputation of this game speaks for itself, however, if you want a more indept military shooter; join the army! This game is in it's own class....", "timestamp_created": 1368641158, "timestamp_updated": 1368641158, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5437151", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049752317", "personaname": "Heavy Metal", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198049752317/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 17027, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 145, "last_played": 1739125519, "avatar": "dc708b9784f42d6e7c44ec98d14bd0c5027166d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Simulator of a future war.", "timestamp_created": 1368621730, "timestamp_updated": 1368621730, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_duri